maya-benchmark 1
# The lights test scene (#1034): a low sun with four shadow cascades over 35 props, 16 point lights,
# and 6 spot lights casting shadows. The spot lights rank first, so the view draws the 16-light limit
# (6 spot, 10 point; 6 point lights are left out) and renders four spot shadow maps. Per-pass GPU times
# give the sun and spot shadow passes and the lit view's cost.
name "lights-scene"
workload scene
project "../samples/basic_scene"
scene "lights.scene"
resolution 1920 1080
warmup 300
samples 3000
runs 3
